<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money supply figures delayed.</title>
<headline>S.African money supply figures delayed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African September money supply figures, due at 1500 GMT, had still not been released at 1510 GMT.</p>
<p>Reserve Bank officials were not immediately available to explain the delay.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
